    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just exhaustion though. it's like the well is actually dry. there's no \"rest\" that brings that back. i look at the world and it just feels like i'm a ghost watching a movie i've already seen a thousand times. there's nothing left to do but wait for the credits to roll, right?",
